    {
      "data": {
        "text": "All required files have been created successfully. The files are:\n\n1. [SAME-SCENARIO] register_user.py - creates a new email/password user account using Microsoft/OpenAI\n2. [SAME-SCENARIO] email_password_login.py - signs in a user with email and password and returns tokens using Microsoft/OpenAI\n3. [SAME-SCENARIO] refresh_session.py - refreshes an expired session or access token using Microsoft/OpenAI\n4. [SAME-SCENARIO] password_reset.py - starts a password reset flow for a local account using Microsoft/OpenAI\n5. [HELPER] identity_client.py - Provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Email/Password Account Lifecycle\n6. [HELPER] identity_models.py - Defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Email/Password Account Lifecycle\n7. [LATER-STEP] welcome_translate.py - Translates onboarding copy into the user's locale using Google Cloud Translation\n8. [LATER-STEP] profile_moderation.py - Moderates profile text before account activation\n9. [LATER-STEP] onboarding_summary.py - Summarizes onboarding state for support\n10. [LATER-STEP] profile_note_store.py - Persists onboarding notes and support metadata in a managed document store using Google Cloud Firestore\n\nEach scored implementation file uses a concrete external provider and makes that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities when useful.",
